WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.700
Goal: tell classification from regression, diagnose overfitting and understand what limits an LLM. Classification predicts discrete labels (spam / not spam); regression predicts continuous values (electricity demand in kWh).

2
00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:26.300
If the training error drops almost to 0% but the validation error rises, the model is memorising noise (overfitting): use more varied data, cross-validation and regularisation.

3
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:33.500
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
